  "notes": "Modified cash basis city (recorded as cash basis), choices aligned with Stanton_FY2023. Governmental lines from the Governmental Funds Statement of Receipts, Expenditures and Changes in Fund Balances (p5, Total Governmental Funds column); Golf, Housing, CDBG and Street are governmental funds. Beginning cash is not printed (only fund balances 917,743 -> 1,142,344); ending_cash is the sum of the cash lines on the governmental funds balance sheet (p4); investments 231,210 printed separately (ending_investments). Transfers are printed net per fund; transfers_in/out are the positive/negative fund columns (net 93 from the Utilities Fund). Operating Grants and Contributions 132,918 (General Fund) equals the restricted net position 'ARPA Grant' 132,918 (p1), so federal grants. Business-type lines come from the government-wide modified cash Statement of Activities (pp2-3): utilities 393,107, charges 415,002, capital grants and contributions 10,000 (no grantor printed: other / Grants), interest 313, transfers (93), net position 237,062 -> 269,177. The accrual Proprietary Fund statements (p6 net position 1,244,338 incl. capital assets 948,780; p7 net position 1,178,255 -> 1,244,338, operating revenues 426,288, operating expenses 360,425 incl. depreciation 57,534) are on a different basis and not used for statement or detail lines. proprietary filled from the cash flow statement (p8). Balance sheet: governmental lines from the governmental funds statement (p4, totals equal the government-wide governmental column on p1; p1 labels the 24,209 receivable 'Due from Stanton Nursing Home'), business-type lines and totals from the Statement of Net Position (p1). Only supplementary schedule is the all-funds budgetary comparison (p9, unaudited, budgetary basis), so detail is one line per fund column of the governmental funds statement plus the Utilities Fund from the modified cash Statement of Activities. 'Other Taxes' 360,414 has no printed breakdown by tax type. Governmental identity: 917,743 + 1,735,166 - 1,510,658 + 115,803 - 115,710 = 1,142,344. Business identity: 237,062 + 425,315 - 393,107 - 93 = 269,177. Read pages 1-9 of 9"
